msgstr "F4 C 实现"

msgid ""
"Resource admission, static binding, deadlines, borrows, callbacks, drain and"
" lifecycle"
msgstr "资源接纳、静态绑定、deadline、借用、回调、排空和生命周期"

msgid "F4 facts"
msgstr "F4 事实"

msgid "Exact part, device macro, memory, startup, IRQ/DMA and reviewed routes"
msgstr "精确料号、设备宏、内存、启动、IRQ/DMA 与经审阅的路线"

msgid "Board"
msgstr "Board"

msgid "Actual wiring, oscillators, initial levels and electrical conditions"
msgstr "实际接线、晶振、初始电平与电气条件"

msgid "Public I/O"
msgstr "公共 I/O"

msgid ""
"Stable Nexus types, checked dispatch and hardware-independent contracts"
msgstr "稳定的 Nexus 类型、经检查的分派与硬件无关合同"

msgid "External product"
msgstr "外部产品"

msgid "Tasks, execution progress, private regions and recovery policy"
msgstr "任务、执行推进、私有区域与恢复策略"

msgid ""
"One live hardware behavior domain has one transport owner. HAL and a private"
" state machine must not independently drive the same transfer, DMA or "
"interrupt sources. A hybrid mode needs explicit ownership boundaries, not "
"two competing executors. Direct access requires a specific SDK gap, erratum,"
" atomic ordering contract or demonstrated resource budget."
msgstr ""
"一个活动硬件行为域只有一个传输所有者。HAL 与私有状态机不得独立驱动同一传输、DMA "
"或中断源。混合模式需要明确所有权边界，不能有两个竞争执行器。直接访问必须有明确的 SDK 缺口、勘误、原子顺序合同或经证实的资源预算依据。"

msgid "Build-time provider contract"
msgstr "构建期 provider 合同"

msgid ""
"One schema-2 TOML selects a complete assembly. Reviewed JSON facts resolve "
"into immutable named IR; the generator creates exact storage, configuration,"
" interface faces, typed factory identities and fixed connections. CMake owns"
" the actual source and link graph. Do not duplicate source lists in a "
"manifest."
msgstr ""
"一个 schema-2 TOML 选择完整 assembly。经审阅的 JSON 事实解析为不可变具名 IR；生成器创建精确存储、配置、接口面、类型化 "
"factory 身份与固定连接。CMake 负责真实的源码及链接图。不得在 manifest 中重复维护源码列表。"

msgid ""
"Each image chooses one exact CMSIS device macro and matching startup. "
"Compile only selected HAL modules and required dependencies, with a "
"consistent private configuration and callback ABI. Do not enable every "
"module or modify vendor files. All other inventoried vendor sources remain "
"retained and unselected."
msgstr ""
"每个镜像选择一个精确 CMSIS 设备宏及匹配的启动文件。仅编译所选 HAL 模块和必需依赖，并保持一致的私有配置与回调 "
"ABI。不得启用全部模块或修改厂商文件。其余已盘点厂商源码继续保留且不被选用。"

msgid ""
"Default host generation remains centralized Python; Board and SoC trees "
"contain no Python plugins. The generator emits static configuration and "
"fixed typed connections. Core's C platform lifecycle engine owns startup, "
"stop, rollback and diagnostics; F4's `platform_coordinator.c` owns System "
"and shared-resource sequencing with the concrete owners' original receipts. "
"The centralized host configuration implementation is not linked into "
"firmware. Generated factories, C models, linked ARM images and physical "
"behavior retain their separate validation boundaries."
msgstr ""
"默认主机生成器集中使用 Python；Board 和 SoC 树不包含 Python 插件。生成器输出静态配置和固定的类型化连接。Core 的 C "
"平台生命周期引擎负责启动、停止、回滚和诊断；F4 的 `platform_coordinator.c` 使用具体 owner 的原始记录协调 "
"System 和共享资源。集中式主机配置实现不链接到固件。生成 factory、C 模型、ARM 镜像和物理行为保留独立的验证边界。"

msgid "Selected F407 HAL UART transport"
msgstr "所选 F407 HAL UART transport"

msgid ""
"The current finite `dma-tx` selection combines official HAL TX with a "
"disjoint LL IRQ byte/event receiver under one private static owner. Handles,"
" DMA state and callbacks stay private. Other UART modes retain their "
"explicit engines; this selection does not establish whole-library or all-"
"mode HAL replacement."
msgstr ""
"当前有限 `dma-tx` 选择，在同一个私有静态所有者下组合官方 HAL TX 与职责不重叠的 LL IRQ 字节/事件接收。Handle、DMA "
"状态及回调保持私有。其他 UART 模式保留各自明确的引擎；此选择不代表已完成整个库或全部模式的 HAL 替换。"

msgid ""
"DMA completion is distinct from UART wire TC. A callback, successful abort "
"call or timeout does not authorize reuse of a request or buffer. Detach "
"actual DMA, IRQ and callback references, prove required peripheral drain, "
"then publish SETTLED as the provider's final request access. Failed "
"withdrawal retains the same storage and recovery responsibility."
msgstr ""
"DMA 完成与 UART 线路 TC 分别表示不同事实。回调、成功的 abort 调用或超时，都不允许复用请求或缓冲区。必须移除真实 DMA、IRQ "
"和回调引用，证明所需外设已排空，再将 SETTLED 发布为 provider 对请求的最后一次访问。退出失败时保留同一存储和恢复责任。"

msgid ""
"Do not unconditionally call `HAL_Init()`: default SysTick setup and NVIC "
"grouping must respect Platform and RTOS ownership. Use the maintained time "
"domain and validate any kernel ISR ceiling before entering a kernel API."
msgstr ""
"不得无条件调用 `HAL_Init()`：默认 SysTick 设置与 NVIC 分组必须遵守 Platform 和 RTOS "
"所有权。使用受维护的时间域，并在进入内核 API 前验证对应的内核 ISR 优先级上限。"

msgid "F407 DAC DMA restart boundary"
msgstr "F407 DAC DMA 重启边界"

msgid "The selected F407 DAC DMA path handles ES0182 Rev19 section 2.6.1 across requests. After request acceptance, restart first proves that the old DMA, IRQ and addresses are detached. It installs the declared idle code, uses the exclusively owned TIM6/7 hardware trigger to observe UDR, then withdraws DMAEN, converter output and clock before reconfiguring DAC, DMA and trigger state. The same owner retains every partial effect if cleanup or clock restoration fails; a timeout never releases the payload early."
msgstr "所选 F407 DAC DMA 路径处理跨 request 的 ES0182 Rev19 第 2.6.1 节边界。请求受理后，重启先证明旧 DMA、IRQ 和地址已经退出，安装声明的 idle 码，通过独占 TIM6／7 硬件触发观察 UDR，再撤回 DMAEN、转换器输出和 clock，随后重新配置 DAC、DMA 与 trigger 状态。清理或时钟恢复失败时，同一 owner 保留每个部分效果；timeout 不提前归还 payload。"

msgid "Only UDR induced during the explicitly controlled recovery phase belongs to recovery rather than payload progress or an independent operational error. It does not by itself replace an expired TIMEOUT with IO. Normal operational underrun still requires explicit stop recovery; failed W1C clearing and real DMA errors remain IO with borrows retained. This is not a rule to ignore every UDR observation."
msgstr "只有显式受控恢复阶段诱发的 UDR 归属恢复，不作为 payload 进度或独立运行故障；它不会单独把已经到期的 TIMEOUT 改为 IO。正常运行欠载仍须显式 stop 恢复；W1C 清零失败和真实 DMA 错误仍是 IO 并保留借用。这不是忽略所有 UDR 观察的规则。"

msgid "Recovery may internally convert the declared idle code before waveform timing starts and briefly disable converter output. These conversions are not payload progress. No uninterrupted analog hold, glitch-free transition or continuous waveform is promised between requests. The C model and ARM image do not establish a silicon-workaround or analog-load qualification. See the [near-source DAC contract](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/README.md#dac-输出与触发所有权) and public `dac_tx.h` requirements; this is a selected recovery sequence, not a second HAL owner or a general register-script mechanism."
msgstr "恢复可能在波形计时开始前内部转换所声明的 idle 码，并短暂关闭转换器输出。这些转换不是 payload 进度。两次 request 之间不承诺连续模拟保持、无毛刺切换或连续波形。C 模型与 ARM 镜像不建立硅片勘误方案或模拟负载资格。参见[近源 DAC 合同](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/README.md#dac-输出与触发所有权)和公共 `dac_tx.h` 要求；这是所选恢复序列，不是第二个 HAL owner 或通用寄存器脚本机制。"

msgid "F479 LTDC scanout and DMA2D memory operations"
msgstr "F479 LTDC 扫描输出与 DMA2D 内存操作"

msgid "The selected software reference is STM32F479NIH6. LTDC uses the reviewed AF14 RGB565 or RGB888 wire route; framebuffer memory independently uses RGB565 or ARGB8888. DMA2D has no external pins or DMA1/2 stream. These selections do not qualify a panel, PCB, external framebuffer, bus bandwidth or physical output. FMC presence alone never adds an external region to either engine's DMA domains."
msgstr "所选软件参考为 STM32F479NIH6。LTDC 使用经审核的 AF14 RGB565 或 RGB888 线上路线；帧缓冲内存独立选择 RGB565 或 ARGB8888。DMA2D 没有外部引脚，也不取得 DMA1／2 stream。这些选择不建立面板、PCB、外部帧缓冲、总线带宽或物理输出资格。仅存在 FMC 不会把外部区域加入任一引擎的 DMA 域。"

msgid "Exact responsibility"
msgstr "精确责任"

msgid "System"
msgstr "System"

msgid "Live bus/time domain and the one PLLSAI plan; LTDC consumes its R output and optional SAI shares Q"
msgstr "有效总线／时间域和唯一 PLLSAI 计划；LTDC 使用 R 输出，可选 SAI 共享 Q"

msgid "Platform"
msgstr "Platform"

msgid "GPIO gates, original pad snapshots and final pad restoration"
msgstr "GPIO 时钟、原引脚快照和最终引脚恢复"

msgid "LTDC"
msgstr "LTDC"

msgid "One HAL/controller, two IRQs, selected AF14 pad leases, its gate, two active frame loans and one global pending reload"
msgstr "唯一 HAL／控制器、两个 IRQ、所选 AF14 引脚借用、自有时钟、两个 active frame loans 和一个全局 pending reload"

msgid "DMA2D"
msgstr "DMA2D"

msgid "One HAL/controller, its gate/IRQ and one operation with independently checked source/destination spans"
msgstr "唯一 HAL／控制器、自有时钟／IRQ，以及一项源／目标范围独立校验的操作"

msgid "Application"
msgstr "应用"

msgid "Pixel storage, panel setup, execution progress, wake adapter and recovery policy"
msgstr "像素存储、面板设置、执行推进、wake 适配和恢复策略"

msgid "The shared source-ownership diagram also applies to these two implementations. Solid edges label runtime interface calls; dashed edges label selected source, SDK and static assembly relationships. It adds no runtime forwarding layer and makes no software or physical qualification claim. The table above states the specific runtime resource ownership for this selected graphics slice."
msgstr "共享源码归属图也适用于这两个实现。实线标记运行期接口调用，虚线标记所选源码、SDK 和静态装配关系。图不增加运行时转发层，也不建立软件或物理资格。上表说明本图形切片的具体运行期资源所有权。"

msgid "![FIG-31: F4 source ownership and interface boundaries](../assets/diagrams/driver-source-ownership.svg)"
msgstr "![FIG-31：F4 源码归属与接口边界](../assets/diagrams/driver-source-ownership.svg)"

msgid "FIG-31: F4 source ownership and interface boundaries"
msgstr "FIG-31：F4 源码归属与接口边界"

msgid "Pure `admit` runs before System/GPIO startup. It validates static extents and refuses foreign selected gates or vectors without effects or retained references. `prepare` then acquires each engine's own gate. LTDC programs AF14 through the locked official GPIO HAL and independently checks the resulting fields. Its snapshot storage cannot overlap configuration, layer/region facts, System state or caller pixels. Platform keeps the single original snapshot; the controller withdraws its leased pads to analog after scanout/IRQ retirement, and Platform restores their original values later. Partial failures retain the exact receipt and configuration; they do not authorize reclamation or a second engine owner."
msgstr "纯 `admit` 在 System／GPIO 启动前执行，校验静态范围并拒绝外来所选 gate 或向量，不产生效果或保留引用。随后 `prepare` 取得各引擎自己的时钟。LTDC 通过锁定的官方 GPIO HAL 配置 AF14，并独立检查实际字段。恢复快照不得覆盖配置、layer／region 事实、System 状态或调用者像素。Platform 保留唯一原快照；控制器在 scanout／IRQ 退出后将借用引脚撤为 analog，Platform 随后恢复原值。部分失败保留精确收条和配置，不授权回收存储或建立第二个引擎 owner。"

msgid "`display` exposes one controller face. `query` and `snapshot` select a physical layer; `stop` covers the whole controller. A frame becoming visible does not end its borrow. A replacement can settle the old frame only after its vertical blanking reload took effect and the relevant active configuration and memory access retirement were proved. The shared shadow bank permits one global pending replacement. Cancelling one layer preserves its peer; stopping the controller joins both layers, all publishers and both IRQs before final release."
msgstr "`display` 只提供一个控制器 face。`query` 和 `snapshot` 显式选择物理 layer，`stop` 覆盖整个控制器。frame 可见不表示借用结束；只有垂直消隐 reload 真正生效，并证明相关 active 配置与内存读取退出后，替换才能终止旧 frame。共享 shadow bank 只允许一个全局 pending replacement。取消一层保留另一层；停止控制器必须 join 两层、全部 publisher 与两个 IRQ 才能最终释放。"

msgid "LTDC reload/line IRQs capture actual blanking and active-address evidence for the current stage generation and retirement mask. A reload hint alone is not proof. Task `service` checks current geometry/domain and joins references before publishing SETTLED, including when Task execution occurs after the short blanking window. Old-stage or old-domain evidence is unusable. No hidden worker or mandatory high-rate Task polling is introduced. Clock loss, unproved retirement or refused withdrawal retains the affected loans in quarantine. GCR/reset readback or a CPU barrier alone never proves external memory withdrawal."
msgstr "LTDC reload／line IRQ 在实际消隐中采集与当前 stage 代次、retirement mask 对应的 active 地址证据；仅有 reload hint 不构成证明。Task `service` 检查当前几何／时间域并 join 引用后才发布 SETTLED，即使任务执行已错过短暂消隐窗口。旧 stage 或旧时间域证据不可复用。不引入隐藏 worker 或强制高速 Task 轮询。时钟丢失、无法证明读取退出或拒绝撤回会使相关 loans 保持 quarantine。GCR／reset 读回或单独 CPU 屏障从不证明外部内存退出。"

msgid "DMA2D supports native RGB565/ARGB8888 fill, copy, conversion and straight-alpha blend through the official HAL. Strides use the corresponding source/output pixel width. RGB565-to8888 expands channel bits and adds opaque alpha; 8888-to565 truncates channel low bits. Blend alpha is explicitly multiplied or replaced. RGB at an ARGB result with zero alpha is unspecified; blend-to565 needs a parameter-proven positive input alpha. The provider does not scan pixels to admit an operation, allocate scratch pixels or implement a CPU fallback."
msgstr "DMA2D 通过官方 HAL 提供原生 RGB565／ARGB8888 fill、copy、格式转换与 straight-alpha blend。stride 使用对应源／输出像素宽度。RGB565 转 8888 扩展通道位并补不透明 alpha，8888 转 565 截去通道低位。blend 显式选择 alpha 相乘或替换；ARGB 结果 alpha 为零时 RGB 未定义，blend 到 565 要求参数能够证明输入 alpha 为正。provider 不扫描像素做准入，不分配 scratch 像素，也不提供 CPU fallback。"

msgid "Every complete source/destination capacity must satisfy reachability and alias checks, including request/control/immutable owner metadata. TC is an intent hint; actual START withdrawal, sources, IRQ, publishers and all address references join before SETTLED. Raw hardware errors are collected before W1C even if no ISR ran. An error cannot preserve an old SUCCESS or a valid-output byte count. An already selected TIMEOUT/CANCELLED remains the first terminal cause; a failed withdrawal still quarantines and retains all storage. Partial output is not rolled back."
msgstr "全部源／目标 capacity 都必须通过可达性与别名校验，包括 request／control／不可变 owner 元数据。TC 只是完成意图的 hint；实际 START、源、IRQ、publisher 和所有地址引用退出后才发布 SETTLED。即使 ISR 未执行，也在 W1C 前收集原始硬件错误。错误不能保留旧 SUCCESS 或有效输出字节数；此前已选定的 TIMEOUT／CANCELLED 保留为首个终止原因。撤回失败仍 quarantine 并保留全部存储，部分输出不回滚。"

msgid "The authored timing uses pixel/line counts and explicit polarities; the generator only computes static HAL accumulated values. Pixel frequency comes from the single System PLLSAI R plan and must satisfy the selected DS11118 83 MHz nominal limit. This check is not physical oscillator, load or panel qualification. CLUT/extra packed formats, watermark/suspend modes and additional exact parts remain outside this selected graphics slice."
msgstr "配置时序使用像素／行计数和明确极性；生成器只计算静态 HAL 累计值。像素频率来自唯一 System PLLSAI R 计划，必须满足所选 DS11118 的 83 MHz 名义上限。该检查不是物理振荡器、负载或面板资格。CLUT／额外打包格式、watermark／suspend 模式及其他精确料号仍不在本图形切片范围。"

msgid "Replace a mode and verify it"
msgstr "替换并验证一个模式"

msgid ""
"Start from a complete selected mode and its tests. Preserve RX duties, "
"instance isolation, cancellation, deadlines, partial-start cleanup, late IRQ"
" and failed drain. Switch the complete behavior domain to its chosen "
"implementation before removing the old path; a successful TX fixture alone "
"is insufficient."
msgstr ""
"从一个完整所选模式及其测试开始。保留 RX 责任、实例隔离、取消、deadline、部分启动后的清理、迟到 IRQ "
"和排空失败处理。先将完整行为域切换到选定实现，再移除旧路径；仅通过 TX fixture 不足以完成替换。"

msgid ""
"Compare actual ELF/map and hot paths under the same toolchain and "
"configuration. Directory consolidation itself does not reduce dispatch or "
"guarantee smaller code. See [current support](../delivery/support.md), "
"[ownership](../explanation/ownership.md) and the [provider "
"guide](../guides/provider-porting.md). Physical HIL is not executed."
msgstr ""
"在相同工具链和配置下比较真实 ELF/map "
"与热路径。目录归并本身不会减少分派或保证代码更小。参阅[当前支持](../delivery/support.md)、[所有权](../explanation/ownership.md)和"
" [provider 指南](../guides/provider-porting.md)。物理 HIL 尚未执行。"

msgid "Cortex-M4F short-ISR constraint"
msgstr "Cortex-M4F 短 ISR 约束"

msgid ""
"F407 ES0182 Rev19 section2.1.2 explicitly lists Arm776924 for every listed "
"cut. The exact chip errata, emitted instructions and selected FPU context "
"remain integration obligations; another CPU name does not grant the same "
"workaround."
msgstr ""
"F407 ES0182 Rev19 section2.1.2 明确列出 "
"Arm776924，适用于其中列明的全部芯片修订。精确芯片勘误、实际生成指令和所选 FPU 上下文仍是接入责任；其他 CPU "
"名称不能直接授权使用相同规避方法。"

msgid ""
"The failure requires an enabled FPU and lazy context saving, an interrupted "
"`VDIV` or `VSQRT` whose destination is s0–s15, a handler without floating-"
"point instructions, and exception return within fourteen cycles of the "
"interrupted instruction. The manufacturers' sufficient instruction-count "
"workaround is **more than two executed instructions in every ISR, excluding "
"exception return**. External stack-memory wait states are an alternative "
"source condition, not a premise supplied by these internal-SRAM platform "
"profiles."
msgstr ""
"触发故障需要同时满足：FPU 和延迟上下文保存已启用；目标寄存器为 s0–s15 的 `VDIV` 或 `VSQRT` "
"被中断；处理程序没有浮点指令；并且在被中断指令之后的十四个周期内发生异常返回。厂商提供的充分指令数规避措施是：**每个 ISR "
"实际执行超过两条指令，不计异常返回指令**。外部栈内存的等待状态是来源文档给出的另一种条件；本平台采用内部 SRAM 的配置不提供该前提。"

msgid ""
"F407 startup enables CP10/CP11. Its selected FreeRTOS CM4F port explicitly "
"enables ASPEN/LSPEN. An integer-only current workload therefore does not "
"make the platform FPU-disabled or exclude floating-point application code. "
"Do not silently clear LSPEN in startup: the kernel re-enables it and its "
"context/stack ABI requires a separately reviewed decision."
msgstr ""
"F407 启动开启 CP10／CP11，所选 FreeRTOS CM4F port 明确开启 "
"ASPEN／LSPEN。因此当前负载只使用整数，并不表示平台禁用 FPU，也不排除应用浮点代码。不得在启动中悄然清除 "
"LSPEN：内核会再次开启它，其上下文／栈 ABI 需要单独审查决策。"

msgid ""
"Review the actual installed vector table and reachable instruction prefixes "
"in each emitted configuration. A thin `ldr` plus tail branch needs its "
"callee examined; unreachable `nop` alignment and literal-pool words are not "
"executed work. A default nonreturning fault loop is distinct from an empty "
"returning handler. Apply the same rule to external handlers, "
"spurious/disabled-state fast paths, aliases and compiler/LTO changes. Source"
" line counts and nominal clock frequency cannot prove this condition."
msgstr ""
"审查每份生成配置实际安装的向量表与可达指令前缀。仅有 `ldr` 加尾跳转的薄处理程序还需要检查被调用方；不可达的 `nop` "
"对齐填充和字面量池数据不属于已执行工作。默认的不返回故障循环与空的可返回处理程序不同。外部处理程序、伪中断或禁用状态的快速路径、别名及编译器/LTO "
"变更同样适用此规则。源码行数和标称时钟频率不能证明满足这个条件。"

msgid ""
"Selected-image software review belongs with its actual ELF, resolved input, "
"compiler commands and disassembly. It proves only those installed paths, not"
" every declared mode or a connected device result. A new or replacement "
"external ISR that can return within the excluded short prefix remains an "
"open integration condition until its emitted path or another exact "
"workaround is reviewed."
msgstr ""
"所选镜像的软件审查必须对应其实际 ELF、resolved "
"输入、编译命令和反汇编。审查只证明这些已安装路径，不证明所有声明模式或已连接设备的结果。新增或替换的外部 ISR "
"若仍可能沿上述未满足规避条件的短指令路径返回，就继续保留为集成待办，直到审查其实际生成路径或另一项精确规避措施。"
